  Segment Name: my_segment
  Segment Size: 2097152 bytes (2.0 MB)
  Ring A Size:  524288 bytes (512.0 KB)
  Ring B Size:  524288 bytes (512.0 KB)

Creating shared memory listener...
✓ Listener created and ready
  Address: my_segment

Creating gRPC server...
✓ gRPC server created

Server is now ready to accept connections
Waiting for client to connect...

To connect, run a client with:
  grpc.NewClient("shm://my_segment", grpc.WithShmTransport(), ...)

Calling Accept() (will timeout after 10 seconds if no client connects)...
✗ Timeout waiting for client connection

This is expected - no client connected within 10 seconds.

Server Example Complete

In a production server:
1. Create listener with NewShmListener()
2. Create gRPC server with grpc.NewServer()
3. Register your service implementations
4. Call server.Serve(listener) - blocks handling RPCs
5. Accept() will be called internally for each client

